  "goodToKnow": "Die Rippe is a rib: sich eine Rippe brechen, die Rippenprellung (bruised rib). Humans have 12 pairs. Das Rippchen is a pork rib dish; Frankfurter Rippchen (cured pork chop with sauerkraut) is a Hessian classic. Idiom: Das kann ich mir doch nicht aus den Rippen schneiden means I can't conjure it out of nowhere. Radiators and some vaults also have Rippen. Plural: die Rippen."
